  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Health Sector Support Program - Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands Health Sector Support Program Phase 3 (HSSP3) continues Australia&#x2019;s long-term commitment to strengthen health systems and improve health outcomes for all Solomon Islanders, and is aligned with the priorities of the Ministry of Health and Medical Services National Health Strategic Plans. The investment commenced in 2016, contributing to a Sector Wide Approach, and is delivered through sector budget support to MHMS and a range of implementing partners. Key areas of focus include primary health care, strengthening health systems and responding to COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
